{"id":"feder","lemma":"Feder","pos":"noun","rank":3897,"glosses":["feather","spring (of a machine or gadget)","quill pen"],"ipa":"/ˈfeːdər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/De-at-Feder.ogg/De-at-Feder.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Feder","plural":"Federn"},"examples":[{"text":"Haben alle Vögel Federn?","en":"Do all birds have feathers?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"a bird","l":"Vogel"},null]},{"text":"Raus aus den Federn!","en":"Get out of bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/91231","words":[{"g":"out"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Die Feder ist mächtiger als das Schwert.","en":"The pen is mightier than the sword.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"powerful, mighty","l":"mächtig"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"sword"}]},{"text":"Der Vogel war mit weißen Federn bedeckt.","en":"The bird was covered with white feathers.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a bird"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"white","l":"weiß"},null,{"g":"covered"}]},{"text":"Man hätte mich mit einer Feder umwerfen können.","en":"You could've knocked me down with a feather.","words":[{"g":"one"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to knock over"},{"g":"can, to be able to"}]}]}